<h3 class="has-text-align-center has-text-color" style="color:#ffffff;font-size:26px;line-height:1.6;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:16px">両方の見立てを、まとめてお出しします</h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->
<!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"color":{"text":"#ded8ee"},"typography":{"fontSize":"16px","lineHeight":"2"}},"align":"center"} -->
<p class="has-text-align-center has-text-color" style="color:#ded8ee;font-size:16px;line-height:2">ご来店は不要です。物件の住所と広さだけ分かれば、3営業日でお持ちします。</p>
